Error [jet.ComptimeConstructNotSupported]: `core.mem.address_of` isn't supported by the current evaluator yet
  --> tests/ui/unsafe_and_runtime/mem_address_of_known_binding_is_a_compile_error_not_a_silent_bake.jet:4:29
    |
  4 |     address: comptime { mem.address_of(cell_value) }
    |                             ^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: A `comptime` block runs while compiling, where no value has a runtime address to bake into the program
 Fix: Take the address in runtime code, outside the `comptime` block
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0956
